{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass, still כברת הארץ.</b> Defective in bet, and it is as though written 'ויהי בעוד'." "<b>כברת הארץ.</b> כברת is a plural form, like 'ואוריד כביר יושבים'; it means a place far from the city. <b>And Rachel gave birth.</b> She did not manage to reach Efrat, for up to there was a distance in the land."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:24.174887528Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}